# display_gap_clients_without_calls: Every guest command on a port whose client takes no call: ports 0 and 1 have a page and no display, port 2's display has only a mode_change callback. The present runs the completion at once (raised |= 2, port poked) and counts in the page; the glyph is checked and recorded; show records +0xf20; the doorbell does nothing; sleep and wake only record +0xfb8; the colour matrix is written. No callback is ever called, and the displays count no guest present.
